Source: secubox-device-intel
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: secubox-device-intel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox Device Intel — network asset discovery + fingerprinting
 Scans the LAN for connected devices, fingerprints them (OS, vendor,
 SecuBox/OpenWrt theme markers, LuCI version), and tracks asset
 inventory over time. Distinct from secubox-watchdog (which monitors
 *known* services for health, not unknown devices).
 .
 Distinct from sibling packages in the monitoring cluster:
  - secubox-watchdog — LXC + service + HTTP health monitor.
  - secubox-health-doctor — vital-services check.
  - secubox-netdata, secubox-glances, secubox-metrics — system
    metrics dashboards.
